From: genkigenki <3080081+genkigenki@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:28:46 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 09/26] Clip mode: clear the clip feedback when Loopy goes away
 on Bluetooth.

ble_service gives the link state to smk_apc_ble_link after each event poll.
If the link ended or the central wrote 0 to the MIDI CCCD, smk_apc_ble_link clears the clip feedback.
It clears the cell colours, the queued state, the PLAY and REC feedback, and the latched layout.
Reason: after Loopy closed, the pads kept the old colours and blinks.
Clip mode, the keybed and the sequencer do not change.
The BLE host, the link, the timing and the radio do not change.
tests/smk_clip_ble_clear_test.c runs the real BLE-MIDI host with a disconnect, a CCCD write 0 and a reconnect.
